{"seq":1,"slug":"interaction-patterns","title":"交互模式与状态管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/interaction/interaction-patterns","wordCount":1652,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"交互模式与状态管理\">交互模式与状态管理</h1><p>把一张折线图加上「悬停显示数值」听起来是十分钟的活，直到你要让这张图和旁边的柱状图联动、缩放状态在刷新后还能保留、再加一个「点击图例隐藏系列」——突然之间，散落在各处的 <code>selected</code>、<code>zoomLevel</code>、<code>hoveredId</code>、<code>filteredRange</code> 互相打架，悬停一闪一闪，缩放跳回原点。交互的难点从来不在监听一个 mousemove，而在交互一多之后状态如何归置。这一篇先梳理交互模式，再把重心放在真正棘手的状态管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>可视化交互可以归到 Shneiderman 的信息检索箴言「概览优先，缩放过滤，按需细节」下的几类基本模式：悬停取细节（details-on-demand）、刷选取子集（brushing）、缩放看局部（zoom/pan）、联动跨视图（linking）、筛选减信息（filter）。每一类交互的背后，都对应一份需要被管理的状态。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[用户输入事件&lt;br/&gt;mousemove click drag wheel] --&gt; B[命中检测&lt;br/&gt;找到对应数据项]&#10;  B --&gt; C[更新交互状态&lt;br/&gt;hovered selected zoom range]&#10;  C --&gt; D{状态作用域}&#10;  D --&gt;|单图局部| E[组件内部 state]&#10;  D --&gt;|多图共享| F[提升到共享 store]&#10;  E --&gt; G[重渲染受影响部分]&#10;  F --&gt; H[所有订阅图表同步重渲染]&#10;  G --&gt; I[视觉反馈]&#10;  H --&gt; I\">flowchart TD\n  A[用户输入事件&lt;br/&gt;mousemove click drag wheel] --&gt; B[命中检测&lt;br/&gt;找到对应数据项]\n  B --&gt; C[更新交互状态&lt;br/&gt;hovered selected zoom range]\n  C --&gt; D{状态作用域}\n  D --&gt;|单图局部| E[组件内部 state]\n  D --&gt;|多图共享| F[提升到共享 store]\n  E --&gt; G[重渲染受影响部分]\n  F --&gt; H[所有订阅图表同步重渲染]\n  G --&gt; I[视觉反馈]\n  H --&gt; I</pre><p>不同交互模式与其状态、命中检测方式的对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交互模式</th>\n<th>触发事件</th>\n<th>维护的状态</th>\n<th>命中检测方式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>悬停细节</td>\n<td>mousemove</td>\n<td>hoveredId</td>\n<td>最近点查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>刷选</td>\n<td>drag</td>\n<td>selectedRange/Set</td>\n<td>范围/区域包含</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缩放平移</td>\n<td>wheel/drag</td>\n<td>transform（缩放+平移）</td>\n<td>坐标变换</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>联动高亮</td>\n<td>任一图的悬停</td>\n<td>共享 hoveredId</td>\n<td>跨图广播</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图例筛选</td>\n<td>click</td>\n<td>visibleSeries</td>\n<td>系列开关</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"命中检测-交互的第一步\">命中检测：交互的第一步</h2><p>任何交互都要先回答「用户指向的是哪个数据项」。在 SVG 里这是免费的——事件目标就是被点的元素（见 <a href=\"../rendering/svg-canvas-webgl\">SVG、Canvas 与 WebGL 取舍</a>）。但在 Canvas/WebGL 里画布是一整块位图，没有「元素」可言，命中检测必须自己实现。</p>\n<p>朴素做法是遍历所有数据点算距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 复杂度在大数据下会让每次 mousemove 都卡顿。正确做法是用空间索引：对二维散点用四叉树（quadtree），把平面递归切成象限，查询最近点只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。给定鼠标位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(m_x, m_y)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，要找的是使欧氏距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msqrt><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>m</mi><mi>y</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sqrt{(x_i - m_x)^2 + (y_i - m_y)^2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.24em;vertical-align:-0.3231em;\"></span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9169em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.2em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7401em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.989em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.8769em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.2em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.28em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.28em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1296\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M263,681c0.7,0,18,39.7,52,119\nc34,79.3,68.167,158.7,102.5,238c34.3,79.3,51.8,119.3,52.5,120\nc340,-704.7,510.7,-1060.3,512,-1067\nl0 -0\nc4.7,-7.3,11,-11,19,-11\nH40000v40H1012.3\ns-271.3,567,-271.3,567c-38.7,80.7,-84,175,-136,283c-52,108,-89.167,185.3,-111.5,232\nc-22.3,46.7,-33.8,70.3,-34.5,71c-4.7,4.7,-12.3,7,-23,7s-12,-1,-12,-1\ns-109,-253,-109,-253c-72.7,-168,-109.3,-252,-110,-252c-10.7,8,-22,16.7,-34,26\nc-22,17.3,-33.3,26,-34,26s-26,-26,-26,-26s76,-59,76,-59s76,-60,76,-60z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3231em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 最小的点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>，四叉树能在不遍历全部点的情况下剪枝定位。这套空间索引在 <a href=\"large-data-performance\">大数据量渲染与性能</a> 里还会用于渲染层的可见性裁剪。</p>\n<p>悬停交互还有个细节：要给 mousemove 加节流（throttle），把高频事件降到每帧最多处理一次，否则一次拖动会触发上百次命中检测和重渲染。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态管理-交互工程的真正难点\">状态管理：交互工程的真正难点</h2><p>交互状态可以按作用域分两层。局部状态只影响一张图自己——比如某个图当前的悬停项，放在组件内部即可。共享状态要跨多张图同步——比如「主图刷选的时间范围」要同时过滤详情图和统计图，这份状态必须提升到一个共享位置，所有相关图表订阅它。</p>\n<p>判断状态该放哪，用一条简单规则：一个状态有几个消费者？只有一个消费者就放局部，多个消费者就提升。这正是 <a href=\"../rendering/d3-low-level\">D3.js 与底层可视化</a> 里「D3 管数学、框架管渲染」之外的另一条职责分离——状态归属。把所有状态一股脑塞进全局 store，会让局部的悬停变化引发全局重渲染，性能和可维护性双输；反过来，把该共享的选区藏在某个图组件里，联动就无从实现。</p>\n<p>在 React 项目里，共享交互状态的载体通常是一个轻量 store（如 Zustand）或 Context + reducer，而非各组件各自的 useState。一份典型的可视化交互状态形状：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const useVizStore = create((set) =&gt; ({&#10;  hoveredId: null, // 跨图联动高亮&#10;  brushRange: null, // 刷选范围 [start, end]&#10;  zoom: { k: 1, x: 0, y: 0 }, // 缩放变换&#10;  visibleSeries: new Set(allSeriesIds), // 图例筛选&#10;  setHovered: (id) =&gt; set({ hoveredId: id }),&#10;  setBrush: (range) =&gt; set({ brushRange: range }),&#10;}));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const useVizStore = create((set) => ({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  hoveredId: null, // 跨图联动高亮</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  brushRange: null, // 刷选范围 [start, end]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  zoom: { k: 1, x: 0, y: 0 }, // 缩放变换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  visibleSeries: new Set(allSeriesIds), // 图例筛选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setHovered: (id) => set({ hoveredId: id }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  setBrush: (range) => set({ brushRange: range }),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>关键设计是把交互状态与原始数据分开存：数据是不可变的源，交互状态是叠加在数据之上的「视图状态」。派生数据（如「当前刷选范围内的子集」）应当在渲染时由数据加状态算出，而不是单独存一份，否则两份数据迟早不同步——这呼应了 React 里「派生态在 render 期算」的原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"联动多视图-协调式视图\">联动多视图：协调式视图</h2><p>多张图共享一份状态、互相响应，就构成协调式多视图（coordinated multiple views）。最常见的两种联动是刷选联动（brushing &amp; linking）——在一张图上刷选一段，其他图高亮或过滤出对应数据；以及焦点高亮——鼠标悬停一图的某条数据，所有图都高亮同一条。</p>\n<p>实现的关键是「单一数据源 + 广播」：选区/悬停状态只存一份在共享 store，每张图既是这份状态的生产者（用户在它上面操作时写入），又是消费者（订阅状态变化后重渲染）。要避免的陷阱是循环更新——A 图更新状态触发 B 图重渲染，B 图重渲染又错误地写回状态触发 A 图，形成死循环。解法是区分「用户操作引起的状态写入」和「状态变化引起的纯渲染」，只有前者才写 store。这套联动机制是 <a href=\"../practice/dashboard-architecture\">仪表盘架构与组合</a> 的核心，那里会讲多个图表组件如何在仪表盘层面被编排。</p>\n<h2 id=\"交互的可发现性与可撤销\">交互的可发现性与可撤销</h2><p>交互做出来还要让人发现得了、用得安心。可发现性方面，可缩放的区域要有视觉暗示（光标变化、提示文字），可点击的图例要有 hover 反馈。可撤销方面，缩放和筛选这类「改变了视图」的操作要提供「重置」入口，让用户能一键回到概览——这直接服务于「概览优先」的箴言。键盘可达性也是交互不可省的一环：刷选、缩放、悬停都应有键盘等价操作，完整方案见 <a href=\"../practice/accessible-responsive-charts\">可访问与响应式图表</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>交互模式可归到「概览优先，缩放过滤，按需细节」之下：悬停、刷选、缩放、联动、筛选，每类对应一份状态。</li>\n<li>任何交互先做命中检测；Canvas/WebGL 无元素，须用四叉树等空间索引把最近点查找从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>状态管理是交互的真正难点：按「消费者数量」决定状态放局部还是提升到共享 store。</li>\n<li>交互状态与原始数据分开存，派生数据在渲染时算出，避免两份数据不同步。</li>\n<li>多视图联动靠「单一数据源 + 广播」，区分「用户写入」与「纯渲染」以避免循环更新。</li>\n<li>交互要兼顾可发现性、可撤销与键盘可达；联动机制延伸到 <a href=\"../practice/dashboard-architecture\">仪表盘架构与组合</a>，无障碍交互见 <a href=\"../practice/accessible-responsive-charts\">可访问与响应式图表</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"交互模式与状态管理","id":"交互模式与状态管理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"命中检测：交互的第一步","id":"命中检测-交互的第一步"},{"level":2,"text":"状态管理：交互工程的真正难点","id":"状态管理-交互工程的真正难点"},{"level":2,"text":"联动多视图：协调式视图","id":"联动多视图-协调式视图"},{"level":2,"text":"交互的可发现性与可撤销","id":"交互的可发现性与可撤销"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"图表库与高层抽象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/rendering/charting-libraries"},"next":{"title":"大数据量渲染与性能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-data-visualization/interaction/large-data-performance"}}